FINAL ANSWER:
## 🚌 Bus Factor Analysis
Period: all history | Generated: 2026-10-22

The repo is small: 7 JS source files and 1 main library file. Treat the percentages below with that in mind.

### Project-level bus factor: 2

Two people, Troy Goode and Douglas Christopher Wilson, account for about 238 of the ~270 non-merge commits. If both left, almost no one would be left who knows the code. Troy Goode is the most recent committer (2026-04-10) and has the largest share of the core file.

### Overview

| Metric | Value |
|---|---|
| Source files analyzed | 7 |
| Files with bus factor 1 | 2 (29%), both tests with 1 commit each |
| Files with bus factor 2 | 1 (14%) |
| Files with bus factor 3+ | 4 (57%) |
| Critical single-owner files | 0 |

### Single-contributor files

| File | Sole owner | Commits | Risk |
|---|---|---|---|
| `test/vary.js` | Troy Goode | 1 | LOW (one test file) |
| `test/support/env.js` | Douglas Christopher Wilson | 1 | LOW (one test helper) |

No file with high importance has a single contributor.

### Concentration without bus factor 1

| File | Contributors | Primary owner | Share |
|---|---|---|---|
| `lib/index.js` (core library) | 25 | Troy Goode | 29/62 commits (47%) |
| `package.json` | 2 or more | Douglas Christopher Wilson | 68 commits, with Troy Goode at 37 |
| `README.md` | 2 or more | Troy Goode | 29 commits (about 80% of those in the top two) |
| `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | 3 or more | Douglas Christopher Wilson | 10 commits |
| `HISTORY.md` | 2 | Douglas Christopher Wilson | 4 of 5 commits |

`lib/index.js` is imported or required by the test files and `package.json`, so it is the file that matters most. It has 25 contributors, so it is not a single-owner file.

### Owner activity

| Person | Last commit | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Troy Goode | 2026-04-10 | No commits in the last 90 days, about 6 months ago |
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 2021-09-07 | Inactive for about 5 years |

Nobody has committed in the last 90 days. The most recent commit in the repo is 2026-04-12.

