repo/
├── lib/index.js   [█████░░░░░] 🟡 25 contributors (Troy Goode 47%)
├── test/          [████░░░░░░] 🟢 mostly 3+ contributors, 2 files with 1
├── package.json   [███████░░░] 🟡 Wilson and Goode only (Wilson 68 commits)
